<title>NEW ZEALAND: Iddison announces 1 for 2 rights issue.</title>
<headline>Iddison announces 1 for 2 rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iddison Group Vietnam on Monday announced that it would make a 1 for 2 renounceable rights issue at NZ$0.25 per share to shareholders to raise approximately NZ$2 million.</p>
<p>The issue will be fully underwritten by D F Mainland &amp; Company Ltd.</p>
<p>Iddison also said that following completion of the issue, it would make a bonus issue of options to all shareholders.</p>
<p>Full details would be given shortly.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
